ww.huntingdencarpets.com/services-5\" target=\"_self\">More</a><p class=\"font_8\" style=\"font-size:60px; line-height:2.5em;\">About</p><h2 class=\"font_2\" style=\"line-height:normal; font-size:44px;\">Suppliers</h2><p class=\"font_8\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:20px;\">Over the years we have developed strong relationships with our suppliers to continue to provide a premium service centred about luxury, versatility and meeting our customers expectations.</p><img alt=\"cb-logo_edited_edited.jpg\" src=\"assets/cb-logo_edited_edited-37.jpg\" style=\"width: 491px; height: 257px; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 50%;\"/><ol class=\"HhjGmK\"><li aria-current=\"true\"><a aria-label=\"Slide  1\" class=\"x8rUIu Fd6sGQ\" href=\"./#comp-ksmiq1v4\"></a></li></ol><h2 class=\"font_2\" style=\"font-size:44px;\">Showroom</h2><p class=\"font_8\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:normal;\">Huntingden Carpets is a family-owned enterprise with generations of experience in the flooring industry. We are an independent retailer and our specialties include carpet and timber flooring, vinyl and rugs.</p>\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:normal;\"> </p>\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:normal;\">Since our inception, Huntingden Carpets has become known for its uncompromising focus on high quality service and eye for detail.</p>\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:normal;\">​</p>\n<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:normal;\">We have since established a strong presence in the residential and commercial flooring industry. </p><h2 class=\"font_2\" style=\"line-height:normal; font-size:44px;\">Get a Free Quote</h2><label class=\"wPeA6j wixui-text-input__label\" for=\"input_comp-lcjrdpmu2\">First Name</label><label class=\"wPeA6j wixui-text-input__label\" for=\"input_comp-lcjrdpn1\">Last Name</label><label class=\"wPeA6j wixui-text-input__label\" for=\"input_comp-lcjrdpn23\">Email</label><